00:20.670"><span begin="00:17.910" end="00:18.060">I'll </span><span begin="00:18.060" end="00:18.510">take </span><span begin="00:18.510" end="00:18.840">you </span><span begin="00:18.840" end="00:19.590">to </span><span begin="00:19.590" end="00:20.670">places</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.670" end="00:23.700"><span begin="00:20.670" end="00:21.030">Past </span><span begin="00:21.030" end="00:22.440">several </span><span begin="00:22.440" end="00:23.700">faces</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.700" end="00:33.030"><span begin="00:23.700" end="00:25.566">Just </span><span begin="00:25.566" end="00:27.432">livin' </span><span begin="00:27.432" end="00:29.298">life </span><span begin="00:29.298" end="00:31.164">so </span><span begin="00:31.164" end="00:33.030">carefreely</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.030" end="00:35.130"><span begin="00:33.030" end="00:33.360">If </span><span begin="00:33.360" end="00:33.960">I </span><span begin="00:33.960" end="00:34.200">could </span><span begin="00:34.200" end="00:34.650">sail </span><span begin="00:34.650" end="00:34.740">a </span><span begin="00:34.740" end="00:35.130">boat</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.130" end="00:38.430"><span begin="00:35.130" end="00:36.240">l'd </span><span begin="00:36.240" end="00:37.170">cruise </span><span begin="00:37.170" end="00:37.650">across </span><span begin="00:37.650" end="00:37.770">the </span><span begin="00:37.770" end="00:38.430">seas</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.790" end="00:45.210"><span begin="00:38.790" end="00:39.210">A </span><span begin="00:39.210" end="00:40.440">sweet </span><span begin="00:40.440" end="00:41.760">adventure </span><span begin="00:41.760" end="00:43.680">for </span><span begin="00:43.680" end="00:43.890">us </span><span begin="00:43.890" end="00:45.210">two</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.210" end="00:47.910"><span begin="00:45.210" end="00:45.330">l'll </span><span begin="00:45.330" end="00:45.630">be </span><span begin="00:45.630" end="00:46.320">Jack </span><span begin="00:46.320" end="00:46.860">and </span><span begin="00:46.860" end="00:47.370">you </span><span begin="00:47.370" end="00:47.910">Rose</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.910" end="00:50.850"><span begin="00:47.910" end="00:48.330">Just </span><span begin="00:48.330" end="00:48.720">please </span><span begin="00:48.720" end="00:49.230">don't </span><span begin="00:49.230" end="00:49.920">let </span><span begin="00:49.920" end="00:50.400">me </span><span begin="00:50.400" end="00:50.850">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.850" end="00:56.280"><span begin="00:50.850" end="00:51.480">'Cause </span><span begin="00:51.480" end="00:51.720">I'll </span><span begin="00:51.720" end="00:52.170">be </span><span begin="00:52.170" end="00:52.950">nothing </span><span begin="00:52.950" end="00:54.510">without </span><span begin="00:54.510" end="00:56.280">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.010" end="01:03.360"><span begin="00:59.010" end="00:59.460">Oh</span><span begin="00:59.460" end="00:59.460">, </span><span begin="00:59.460" end="00:59.850">when </span><span begin="00:59.850" end="01:00.270">you </span><span begin="01:00.270" end="01:02.010">call </span><span begin="01:02.010" end="01:03.360">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.360" end="01:05.640"><span begin="01:03.360" end="01:03.480">l'm </span><span begin="01:03.480" end="01:04.410">drifting </span><span begin="01:04.410" end="01:04.950">on </span><span begin="01:04.950" end="01:05.640">clouds</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.640" end="01:09.090"><span begin="01:05.640" end="01:06.150">Like </span><span begin="01:06.150" end="01:06.540">I'm </span><span begin="01:06.540" end="01:09.090">dreaming</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.920" end="01:15.030"><span begin="01:10.920" end="01:11.670">But </span><span begin="01:11.670" end="01:11.910">in </span><span begin="01:11.910" end="01:12.360">the </span><span begin="01:12.360" end="01:15.030">morning</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.390" end="01:20.040"><span begin="01:15.390" end="01:15.570">I'll </span><span begin="01:15.570" end="01:15.990">wake </span><span begin="01:15.990" end="01:16.470">up </span><span begin="01:16.470" end="01:16.980">and </span><span begin="01:16.980" end="01:17.640">see </span><span begin="01:17.640" end="01:18.150">that </span><span begin="01:18.150" end="01:18.510">you're </span><span begin="01:18.510" end="01:20.040">stuck</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.070" end="01:23.610"><span begin="01:20.070" end="01:21.150">Here </span><span begin="01:21.150" end="01:22.140">with </span><span begin="01:22.140" end="01:23.610">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.400" end="01:54.420"><span begin="01:50.400" end="01:50.850">Oh</span><span begin="01:50.850" end="01:50.850">, </span><span begin="01:50.850" end="01:51.210">when </span><span begin="01:51.210" end="01:51.630">you </span><span begin="01:51.630" end="01:53.460">call </span><span begin="01:53.460" end="01:54.420">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.720" end="01:57.030"><span begin="01:54.720" end="01:54.930">I'm </span><span begin="01:54.930" end="01:55.830">drifting </span><span begin="01:55.830" end="01:56.340">on </span><span begin="01:56.340" end="01:57.030">clouds</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.030" end="02:01.050"><span begin="01:57.030" end="01:57.570">Like </span><span begin="01:57.570" end="01:58.170">l'm </span><span begin="01:58.170" end="02:01.050">dreaming</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.310" end="02:06.870"><span begin="02:02.310" end="02:03.090">But </span><span begin="02:03.090" end="02:03.360">in </span><span begin="02:03.360" end="02:03.810">the </span><span begin="02:03.810" end="02:06.870">morning</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.870" end="02:11.220"><span begin="02:06.870" end="02:06.990">l'll </span><span begin="02:06.990" end="02:07.410">wake </span><span begin="